1
00:00:05,762 --> 00:00:08,552
(Mike:)Hey, Froot Loops,
wanna hit your fan switch?

2
00:00:08,765 --> 00:00:10,185
(Howard:)Check.

3
00:00:11,226 --> 00:00:15,396
(Cosmonaut:)He calls you Froot Loops
because of your very gay haircut?

4
00:00:16,940 --> 00:00:21,440
No, it's because I live with my mom
and she makes me Froot Loops.

5
00:00:22,904 --> 00:00:26,284
(Cosmonaut:)Go with gay story.
People are more accepting of that.

6
00:00:28,076 --> 00:00:32,286
(Mike:)Actually, Froot Loops
just got married to a girl.

7
00:00:32,789 --> 00:00:34,079
(Cosmonaut:)Congratulations.

8
00:00:34,290 --> 00:00:37,000
(Howard:)Thanks.
We decided to do it before the launch.

9
00:00:37,210 --> 00:00:39,460
(Cosmonaut:)You and Mrs. Loops
have a big wedding?

10
00:00:41,714 --> 00:00:42,754
(Howard:)Not exactly.

11
00:00:42,966 --> 00:00:45,716
(Howard:)Listen, if you don't mind,
I'm not really up for chatting.

12
00:00:45,927 --> 00:00:51,267
I'm just gonna sit here quietly
and let my life flash before my eyes.

13
00:00:54,185 --> 00:00:57,225
(Howard:)That went really quick.
Let me try it again.

14
00:01:00,984 --> 00:01:04,194
(Howard:)Close your eyes. Put out your hand.
l got you something special.

